{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-08-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'KROGER ELECTS ELAINE CHAO TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, AUG. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ELAINE CHAO HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. "WE ARE PLEASED TO WELCOME ELAINE TO KROGER," SAID RODNEY MCMULLEN, KROGER\'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO.'}